VERDICT
====================================================================================================
  Done with the framework's pieces only -- the dark charge at its CMB-required mean density, cold and ballistic as the Bullet requires,
  accreting onto a dwarf's MOND well with the external-field effect of its surroundings -- the inner excess is +0.10-0.15 dex against a
  measured room of +0.05-0.09: a marginal excess, uncertain by the shell-placement convention, not the decisive +0.33 dex that LCDM's
  abundance-matching ratio gave.  The first dwarf pincer is DOWNGRADED from decisive to marginal.  The striking framework-native number
  is elsewhere: a MOND well accretes the cold charge copiously -- a dwarf gathers 1e11-1e12 Msun out to 200-500 kpc, an L* galaxy 1.7e13
  out to 900 kpc (130 M_b inside 500 kpc) -- and THAT is what galaxy-galaxy lensing at 100 kpc - 2 Mpc measures.  Next gate: KiDS.

